. La aplicaci\u00f3n cuenta con una interfaz clara y accesible, f\u00e1cil de navegar con las gafas puestas. Crea, edita y elimina alarmas con gestos sencillos y disfruta de notificaciones visuales y sonoras claras que te garantizan que nunca te pierdas un momento importante, ya sea que est\u00e9s jugando, trabajando o relaj\u00e1ndote en RV.", "short_description": "Esta alarma tiene: Temporizador, Cron\u00f3metro y alarma de conversi\u00f3n."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "portrait.png", "id": "2905496342955542", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507823984_2905496346288875_7146297178865334511_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cU-94TF5yeYQ7kNvwG-dHHg&_nc_oc=AdqGhVhgNgCh-tqdvHmSRs0z5m8FlcrBxofrd3Ay0Q79pcm8sNcddjsN-0SQC0BtVjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDfEZewlVSyK2q_JV_AAH0E6WzIbA-p42xqyGXZ4DBAcw&oe=6A5F6DBE"}, {"file_name": "icono-512.png", "id": "2243906042732063", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618482_2243906046065396_1094352884120925797_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=g-nc0WBh4FMQ7kNvwEmslJn&_nc_oc=AdrT6dNPZEEqCT_nZdmHum8JRcafSrj7RmYRtFsEErmZEyW5k9_oOz_7pU-9Nxk9Qyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQATNN6bO2C6qBLTy1_OWB-6rVCsbYTUesHWGZqm9aCudw&oe=6A5F845E"}, {"file_name": "square.png", "id": "1745867016009353", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491831056_1745867019342686_1501165532938032609_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=W_OgP1E7vYQQ7kNvwEJYtWt&_nc_oc=Ado3wzA1Y8LOAmPYbHsSoKrJ9OpaxWr3wNnvV8sphrPMyRbdgJU-SFv-9FKGJ776IzU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCOzsS0JmmNC8fr7pAuwVp_O5DdqWUJ8s88SpXdM_I9Hg&oe=6A5F79DB"}, {"file_name": "hero cover.png", "id": "1368705761087761", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://sco